    "heading": "Cube [Area of Effect]",
    "lineStart": 13041,
    "lineEnd": 13045
  },
  "section": "8.42",
  "rulesText": "A Cube is an area of effect that extends in straight lines from a point of origin located anywhere on a face of the Cube. The effect that creates a Cube specifies its size, which is the length of each side.\n\nA Cube's point of origin isn't included in the area of effect unless its creator decides otherwise."
}
